From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tgwear <tgwear@example.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] build: 配置签名（与手表端快应用签名一致）

把 tgwear-android-patch/signing/tgwear.jks 直接复制到
TMessagesProj/signing/tgwear.jks，由 build.gradle 引用。

store/key 密码均为 tgwear2026（开源仓库可见，与手表端 .pem 同源）。

---
 TMessagesProj/build.gradle | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/build.gradle b/TMessagesProj/build.gradle
--- a/TMessagesProj/build.gradle
+++ b/TMessagesProj/build.gradle
@@
 android {
+    // tgwear: 统一签名配置（与手表端快应用 sign/{debug,release}/*.pem 同源）
+    signingConfigs {
+        tgwear {
+            storeFile file("${rootProject.projectDir}/signing/tgwear.jks")
+            storePassword "tgwear2026"
+            keyAlias "tgwear"
+            keyPassword "tgwear2026"
+        }
+    }
+
     defaultConfig {
@@
     }
     buildTypes {
         debug {
+            signingConfig signingConfigs.tgwear
         }
         release {
+            signingConfig signingConfigs.tgwear
         }
     }
 }
